  "sentences": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_1",
      "text": "在汉语里，有一个很有意思的词：“吃醋”。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4053,
      "durationMs": 4053,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_2",
      "text": "“吃醋”不是真的吃醋。",
      "startMs": 4053,
      "endMs": 6560,
      "durationMs": 2507,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_3",
      "text": "它的意思是：看到你爱的人对别人好，你不高兴。",
      "startMs": 6560,
      "endMs": 11600,
      "durationMs": 5040,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_4",
      "text": "比如，一个女人看到她的男朋友和别的女人说话，她不高兴。",
      "startMs": 11600,
      "endMs": 17240,
      "durationMs": 5640,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_5",
      "text": "她“吃醋”了。",
      "startMs": 17240,
      "endMs": 19360,
      "durationMs": 2120,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_6",
      "text": "所以，“吃醋”就是嫉妒。",
      "startMs": 19360,
      "endMs": 22027,
      "durationMs": 2667,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_7",
      "text": "如果男人吃醋了，是因为他很爱你。",
      "startMs": 22027,
      "endMs": 25560,
      "durationMs": 3533,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "art_cc_8",
      "text": "你也不要每天都吃醋哦！",
      "startMs": 25560,
      "endMs": 27680,
      "durationMs": 2120,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/article_chicu_vinaigre_art_cc_8.mp3"
